And here's an answer to one of your emails.

124
00:07:17,840 --> 00:07:19,840
Often, because of the nature of the questions asked to me in

125
00:07:19,840 --> 00:07:23,840
email, I withhold the names of the people who asked them, in

126
00:07:23,840 --> 00:07:24,840
